	(text "Each board is its own KiCad project with its own PCB; this project only joins their sheets. Do not create a PCB here.\nGenerated by reveng/tools/mk_system.py from reveng/SYSTEM_MAP.txt; edit the map, not this sheet.\nSignal pins join by net labels named after the driver: <card>_<pin> (N24_OUT); N1 pins keep their N1 names. Supplies join through the global power symbols on the boards.\nGND1 = measuring zero, GND2 = supply zero. The cards tie their local grounds to them on their own sheets, as in the ZERO CONNECTIONS inset of each card drawing; N2 LGND2 is tied here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
